WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.637
- It's the people that 
are the best that win.

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:06.746
The market proves it for you.

00:00:06.746 --> 00:00:09.106
So let's go in detail.

00:00:09.106 --> 00:00:11.616
TechCrunch 
doesn't pick the winners.

00:00:13.649 --> 00:00:15.836
The Wall Street Journal 
doesn't pick the winners.

00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:18.386
Three cool kids in the 
crowd don't pick the winners.

00:00:18.386 --> 00:00:21.395
The problem is everybody
wants to be anointed a winner

00:00:21.395 --> 00:00:22.615
or best at what they do

00:00:22.615 --> 00:00:24.365
before they've actually done it.

00:00:24.365 --> 00:00:26.557
Let me just remind you 
and everybody else here,

00:00:26.557 --> 00:00:30.396
I built a business for 
18 hours a day every day

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:34.966
running a wine liquor 
store for 13 years every day

00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:36.525
before I ever had the audacity

00:00:36.525 --> 00:00:39.806
to come to 
something like this and talk.

00:00:41.596 --> 00:00:44.176
Let me tell you 
something amazing.

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:45.816
If you're good enough,

00:00:45.816 --> 00:00:47.145
you will win.

00:00:47.145 --> 00:00:50.368
But if you are upset that 
somebody else's grandpappy

00:00:50.368 --> 00:00:51.919
got them ahead of you,

00:00:51.919 --> 00:00:53.820
then you're gonna lose.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.828
Everybody started ahead of me.

00:00:55.828 --> 00:00:57.246
I'm just catching up.

00:00:57.246 --> 00:01:00.048
("Working Together" by Jura Kez)

